# Mirror of eslint.config.mjs ignores (Prettier does not read that file), plus
# generated output and lockfiles. The two committed example dists are NOT
# gitignored (ADR-0006 commits them on purpose) -- they must be ignored here
# explicitly; they are regenerated by `pnpm build:examples`, never formatted.

# Mirrors eslint ignores
**/dist/**
examples/local-project/.hooknostic/artifacts/**
**/node_modules/**
**/*.snap.*
fixtures/**
.capture/**
examples/*/com.*/

# Generated integration output (written by `hooknostic sync`; CONTRIBUTING
# "Generated output is generated"). Broader than the eslint ignore on purpose:
# sync refuses to run over a hand-modified generated file, so formatting one
# bricks the examples build.
examples/local-project/.hooknostic/**
examples/local-project/.claude/**
examples/local-project/.codex/**
examples/local-project/.opencode/**

# Generated build reports and lockfiles (rewritten by tooling, not by editors)
**/hooknostic-build.json
**/package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Deliberately outside Prettier's scope:
# - markdown: hand-broken prose; scripts/check-version-literals.mjs is
#   line-oriented over tracked *.md and must not be perturbed by re-wrapping
# - YAML: GitHub Actions expressions (${{ }}) in block scalars are the least
#   reliable part of Prettier's YAML support, and Renovate edits workflows and
#   pnpm-workspace.yaml weekly; a formatter/bot disagreement would surface as
#   an unfixable format:check failure on Renovate PRs
*.md
*.yaml
*.yml